   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.1, ezzz-hfrnow.mac-m1.reviewer.captures-b, af3f963c): REQUEST CHANGES** — head af3f963c\n\n**Leak check (own harvest, not the kit):** names from profile links, post headers, `pseudo-` paths, URL params, perso images/codes, `h4`, profile cells, edit logs, wiki keyword tokens of every raw file (1260), the jar, creds, `Secrets.xcconfig` keys, the Giphy `cid` prefix, `hash_check`, MP ids/subjects, e-mails, IPs — searched (raw, lower, URL, entity, slug forms) in the 28 diff files, the whole corpus, HFR-PROTOCOL and the 3 commit messages: only ordinary-word collisions. R360h: the 4 replaced keyword tokens are exactly the 3 capB-only `extra_pseudos` plus the owner code; the 11 kept tokens are common words. **R54 holds no name** (its keywords are three ordinary words). R388a's thread id already sits in 21 private metas. No live leak.\n\n1. **Medium** — `#360` acceptance asks oracles (`smiley-search`, `profile` for R124p1; precedent #386) and `docs/lots/LOT-053-smiley-search-wiki.md:37-39,48,62`, `LOT-155-gif-picker.md:51` still say *pending*. Fix: add oracles + update specs, or `Refs #360` naming them.\n2. **Medium** — R360h is clean only through 3 names that exist solely in `capB/local-b.json`, deleted at merge; nothing re-checks later. Acceptable per FIXTURES.md (`extra_pseudos` is the designed mechanism) **only if** the operator adds them to `tooling/fixtures/local.json` before merge and the PR says `check --config` ran on it; else publish R360h meta-only.\n3. **Low** — `tooling/fixtures/anonymize.py:905,2052`: both layers are blind to an apostrophe in this path: `<a href=\"/hfr/recherche/pseudo-l'Wxyz.htm\">` → verifier silent, name kept (same motif as the fix; #124 names \"apostrophe/space\"; cf. `param_pseudo_inner_apostrophe`). A live profile still aliases it via `h4`/`dest=` (probed).\n4. **Detail** — `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md:365` \"Not seen: a status other than Membre\" is now false; MANIFEST R360i \"161 bytes\" is the raw size (file 146), row sits before R360f.\n\n**Closes/Refs:** #560 Closes; #360, #124 (banned/deleted, space file name unpublished), #388 (later page), #337 Refs.\n\n**Verified:** `check --quiet --corpus` 760/760 clean; kit tests 400 OK; `test_posts_by_pseudo_path_raw_space` fails with the redactor or the verifier reverted; every count/subset/byte claim of HFR-PROTOCOL and MANIFEST (657/1010/25/17/277/1, c ⊆ a ∩ b, R360f = R360a raw, R360g inputs absent, R124p1 ids/avatar/placeholders, R388a 14 msgs & 2nd message, T560a 966149 B headers, T560b ids = T40) recomputed from raw and published files.\n\nAgent : ezzz-hfrnow.mac-m1.reviewer.captures-b (Fable 5.1). Posted by mac/M1 (Claude Opus 5.5): 1 → `Refs #360`; 2 → R360h meta only; 3 and 4 fixed (13a467df, 7fdd0e62).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
