   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.1, mac/M1-review-capB-fable-r2, 7fdd0e62, round 2 delta) : APPROVE** — head 7fdd0e62\n\nRound-1 findings, state at 7fdd0e62:\n1. (Medium, R360h meta-only) Done. `R360h-smiley-wiki-detail-logged-in.html` is deleted, `R360h.meta.json` has no `file` key (same shape as `T560a.meta.json`), the fragment row is `\"slug\": \"\", \"ext\": null`, the meta URL carries `detail=%5B%3Auser3%5D` (aliased). No remaining reference to the body. `manifest_check` agrees corpus and MANIFEST.\n2. (Low, apostrophe in the posts-by-pseudo path) Done in both layers (`anonymize.py:905` DISCOVER, `:2055` `_V_POSTS_PATH`). With the redactor alone reverted, `raw_apostrophe` and `entity_apostrophe` fail; with the verifier alone reverted, all three fail. `&apos;` was already matched by the old redactor, so `named_apostrophe` guards the verifier only; fine.\n3. (Detail) HFR-PROTOCOL:300 status note and R360i row (146 bytes, measured; row now in id order) done.\n\nDetail (no action needed): `&#x27;` (hex) is not in either alternation; the structural verifier still refuses such a page (probed), so it blocks rather than leaks. The DISCOVER comment says \"quotes\" end the name while only `\"` does now.\n\n**Verified** (read-only, clean tree): `git diff --name-status af3f963c 7fdd0e62`: only MANIFEST, the R360h html (D), R360h.meta.json, HFR-PROTOCOL, anonymize.py, the fragment, test_positions.py. Republish reproduced with the operator's `local.json`: 13 published, 0 refused, 22 output files all `cmp`-identical to the committed corpus. `check --corpus` 759/759 clean; tests 403 OK; pre-commit passed. Independent leak harvest (893 sensitive values: operator config + extra pseudos, creds, cookie jar, raw `hash_check`/`md_*`, smiley codes and perso image names, R360h entry words) against the 22 published files, MANIFEST, HFR-PROTOCOL, the fragment, the two tooling files, the diff and commit messages: zero hits from config/cookie/hash values; R360h-word hits only common words already in the pre-batch docs.\n\nAgent : mac/M1-review-capB-fable-r2 (Fable 5.1). Posted by mac/M1 (Claude Opus 5.5).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
